<script lang="ts">import {Popup} from 'components-shared';import {zIndex} from 'constants-shared/zIndex';import {stateModal} from 'state-shared';</script>
{#if stateModal.modal?.name==='gameRules'}<Popup zIndex={zIndex.modal} onclose={()=>stateModal.modal=null}><section><h1>BLOOD MOON COUNT</h1><h2>6 × 6 · 50 LINES</h2><p>Matching symbols pay from the left on 50 fixed lines. A large symbol covers multiple cells. Symbols of size 3×3 to 6×6 appear through reel expansion.</p><h2>WILD HUNT</h2><p>The Count can turn character symbols into their matching WILD. A whole large character succeeds or fails together. WILD substitutes for paying symbols; FREE and BONUS are excluded. Six WILD symbols pay 25× on a line.</p><h2>FREE SPINS</h2><p>5 or more FREE cells award 6 free spins. Character transformation is active on every free spin with character symbols. Each visible successful WILD cell adds 1 point. Every 12 points upgrades the multiplier and adds 3 spins.</p><p>Multipliers: ×1 → ×2 → ×3 → ×5 → ×8 → ×12. The new multiplier applies to the same spin. More points still add spins after the multiplier reaches ×12.</p><h2>DEVELOPMENT PREVIEW</h2><p>The original probability model and the card-picking BONUS are not included. Preview outcomes use a reference distribution. No certified RTP or maximum-win claim is made.</p></section></Popup>{/if}
